The silence is hauntingly peaceful. Darkness cloaks him like a warm
blanket. Tyler is sitting in his house at 3 am, studying intently on how to
perfectly fold a hoodie. Dozens of tabs open, running 2 videos at the same
time, reading articles, Tyler is working so hard to master this craft.

 EERRRREEEECCCHH!

 Tyler looks up and surveys the room. Where did that sound come from? Oh
well. Maybe he=E2=80=99s stayed up too late and is hallucinating. Whatever-=
 he must
continue his studies. Tyler pulls up another video on how to fold hoodies.


=E2=80=9CI wouldn=E2=80=99t do that if I were you.=E2=80=9D

 Tyler looks around again. Who said that? Where did it come from? The voice
sounds eerily like Lauren, but Lauren is nowhere to be seen. Just then, a
floating hoodie drifts into the room.

 =E2=80=9CYou can=E2=80=99t learn how to fold hoodies. They deserve to be f=
ree, not
constricted as so!=E2=80=9D said the hoodie.
=E2=80=9CLauren, is that you?=E2=80=9D questioned Tyler.
=E2=80=9CYes. I have been trapped inside this hoodie. You have to save me!=
=E2=80=9D

 Tyler feels a sudden sense of urgency. He must save Lauren from the
clutches of the hoodie! He knows just where to start. Tyler opens his
window and jumps out, running towards the lake.

 The cold air brushes past his face as he runs faster and faster towards
the lake. But he is suddenly stopped by Gianna. She has a look of pure
horror on her face.
=E2=80=9CYou can=E2=80=99t go there! I=E2=80=99ve already tried to save Lau=
ren. There is no point=E2=80=9D
exclaimed Gianna. Tyler, confused, tries to figure out why. Gianna swiftly
turns into a hat. This is not good.

 Tyler is determined to save the day, so he continues towards the Lake.
Finally he makes it to the lake, and feels the cool mist blowing against
his face. In the middle of the lake sits Olivia, floating and meditating
over the surface of the water. She warns Tyler not to come any closer, but
Tyler has to save his friends.
=E2=80=9CTurn them back into people!=E2=80=9D demanded Tyler. =E2=80=9Cno=
=E2=80=9D proclaimed Olivia very
seriously.

 Tyler begins running on the water. He will do whatever it takes to stop
this madness. Suddenly, Olivia pulls out a magic wand and points it at
Tyler. He realizes too late that he is her next target.

 =E2=80=9CNOOOOOOO!=E2=80=9D Brandon flies across the water, blocking the h=
it from the
magic wand.
=E2=80=9CBrandon, you sacrificed yourself for me?=E2=80=9D asked Tyler. Bra=
ndon lies on the
surface of the water, barely breathing.
=E2=80=9CI know you would do the same for me=E2=80=9D replied Brandon very =
dramatically.
 =E2=80=9CNo Brandon! Stay with me!=E2=80=9D

 Brandon swiftly transforms into a pair of shoes. Before Tyler can fully
register the weight of this sacrifice, Olivia points the wand at him again.
Tyler, still in shock, has no time to react. He faces the magic of her
wand, and is turned into a beautiful dress. Olivia has won again.

The end.

